**/*secret*
**/*credentials*
*.pem
*.key
chat-config.json
character-cards.json
**/chat-config.json
**/character-cards.json

# ── 个人测试脚本（不上传）──
测试Qwen3.0_tts引擎.bat
scripts/qwen3-tts/
切换TTS引擎.bat

# ── Live2D 模型（npm run setup:model 下载；README 保留）──
public/models/hiyori_pro/
public/models/**/
!public/models/README.md

# ── 精选触摸音频：manifest + .wav 入库；用户本地追加的 wav 也可提交 ──
# （不忽略 public/touch_clips/*.wav）

# ── TTS 私有权重（本地放置）──
tts_voice/*.pth
tts_voice/bert/
tts_voice/config.json

# ── 音色工坊：官方 default_sample 参考音入库；运行时缓存不入库 ──
voice_forge/other_custom_cache/**/*
!voice_forge/other_custom_cache/README.md
voice_forge/**/touch_cache/
voice_forge/**/touch_cache.json
voice_forge/**/corpus.snapshot.json
voice_forge/custom_sample/**/*
!voice_forge/custom_sample/README.md

# ── 本地 LLM（自动下载，不入库）──
llama-server.exe
llama_bin/
llama_models/
llama_models/*.gguf

# ── .runtime 内常见本地状态（.runtime/ 已整目录忽略；下列为显式备忘）──
